        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B80, Single Sided Deadbolt</b>\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage One-Sided Turnbolt Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt. Uses thumbturn inside but it does not go through to the outside of the door. Includes reinforced strike plate, easy to install. Available in 10 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b581\"><b>Schlage B581 Commercial Grade 2 Single-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/residential-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b81\"><b>Schlage B81 Residential Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b>Schlage B60 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b62\"><b>Schlage B62 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Schlage B80 Turnbolt Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>Non-graded lock</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Grade 1 (Best grade)</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B80 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Door Thickness</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Face Bore Hole: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. There is no plate or exposed trim on the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
