                "title": "One-Sided Deadbolt, Schlage B80",
                "description": "One-Sided Deadbolt Schlage B80 - Schlage One-Sided Turnbolt Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt. Uses thumbturn inside but it does not go through to the outside of the door. Includes reinforced strike plate, easy to install on almost any door. Available in 10 different finish colors.",
